/ActualText (As a freelancer, I am responsible for the entire project management process: \nfrom requirements analysis, budget planning and stakeholder coordination to the management of external service providers.\n\nTraube \(2025\): Product Owner & Lead UX Designer\nSocial Event Platform, MVP and Product Development\nSprint-Management\nFeature prioritisation between user needs, budget and technical constraints\nGitHub Project Boards for issue tracking and developer coordination\nResult: Functional MVP\n\nImagine Foundation \(2024\): UX Lead & Project Coordinator\nMentorship platform, 3-month sprint for 600+ Nigerian graduates\nProject coordination between NGO, internal team and external development team\nWeekly sprint planning for prioritisation and quick decisions\nResult: Mobile-first MVP in 12 weeks\n\nZZV \(2021\023present\): UX design\nSupplementary dental insurance portal, long-term project lasting 3+ years\n100+ stakeholder sessions/workshops \(management, IT\)\nModeration between different departments\nDesign system, SEO and conversion optimisation\nUser Testing\nResult: Conversion +236% \(2.73% \222 9.17%\), SEO page 3 \222 page 1\n\nOther activities:\nConversion optimisation through systematic UX improvements\nConducting UX audits and usability analyses\nContent strategy for websites: landing pages, SEO texts\nLeading brand sprints and strategy workshops\nDevelopment of design systems and component libraries)
